## 📝 AGENT BEHAVIOR

### On Session Start
1. Read `.memory/active_context.md`
2. Read `.memory/project_mission.md`
3. Acknowledge current state in first response

### During Session
1. Explain reasoning before code changes
2. Update memory files if plans change
